oastal forms</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2016,"cta":{"id":2846,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ELLE_Residences_map_c2fb1fe7e1.jpg","hash":"ELLE_Residences_map_c2fb1fe7e1","name":"ELLE-Residences-map.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Dubai’s Most Future-Focused Waterfront Investment Zones","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>ELLE Residences is located on the main island of Dubai Islands, a visionary waterfront destination reshaping the city’s northern shoreline. Spanning 17 square kilometres and comprising five interconnected islands, Dubai Islands offers over 20 kilometres of beaches, promenades, and green spaces, blending resort living with urban convenience. Residents enjoy direct access to the central boulevard while remaining tucked away from the bustle, with a marina, park, and major shopping mall just steps away and the beach directly across the road. The area is set to become a major tourism magnet with hotels, marinas, and cultural districts, positioning it as one of Dubai’s most future-focused waterfront investment zones.</p><ul><li>05 Minutes to Deira Waterfront</li><li>10 Minutes to Port Rashid</li><li>15 Minutes to Dubai International Airport</li><li>20 Minutes to Downtown Dubai</li><li>35 Minutes to Palm Jumeirah</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4355,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_ac8d9de3f5.pdf","hash":"brochure_ac8d9de3f5","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":3038,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4585,"url":nu