"type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1428,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"ELLE Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"ANAX Developments","project_location":"Dubai Islands"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ELLE_Residences_mobile_70aaefeb68.jpg","hash":"ELLE_Residences_mobile_70aaefeb68","name":"ELLE-Residences-mobile.jpg"},"seo":{"id":2212,"metaTitle":"ELLE Residences Dubai Islands | Luxury Waterfront Apartments by ANAX","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Discover ELLE Residences Dubai Islands – the first ELLE-branded waterfront homes by ANAX Developments, offering 1–3BR apartments and townhouses with sea views."},"more_info":[{"id":9424,"answer":"<p>ELLE Residences Dubai Islands is located on the main island of Dubai Islands, along Dubai’s northern coastline. This prime waterfront destination offers direct access to beaches, marinas, promenades, and leisure attractions, while remaining just minutes from Downtown Dubai and Dubai International Airport. As one of the most ambitious coastal master developments in the city, ELLE Residences Waterfront Dubai enjoys a strategic position combining seafront living with urban connectivity.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is ELLE Residences located?"},{"id":9425,"answer":"<p>ELLE Residences by Anax Developments is developed by ANAX Developments, a future-focused real estate developer under the umbrella of ANAX Holding. Known for bold design, lifestyle-led communities, and high-quality delivery, ANAX Developments brings the globally recognised ELLE brand to Dubai with its first branded residential project in the region.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer of ELLE Residences?"},{"id":9426,"answer":"<p>ELLE Residences apartments offer a curated selection of 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, and 3-bedroom apartments, in addition to a limited number of exclusive townhouses. Each residence is fully equipped and designed to maximise natural light, sea views, and lifestyle functionality, making Elle Residences by Anax ideal for both end users and investors.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of units are available at ELLE Residences?"},{"id":9427,"answer":"<p>ELLE Residences off-plan Dubai is scheduled for completion in Q4 2027. The project is currently under development and forms part of ANAX Developments’ expanding luxury portfolio across Dubai’s most sought-after locations.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When will ELLE Residences be completed?"},{"id":9428,"answer":"<p>ELLE Residences Waterfront Dubai offers a comprehensive range of lifestyle and wellness amenities including a swimming pool, wellness spa, indoor and outdoor gyms, outdoor cinema, sky lounge with roof bar, yoga and meditation areas, concierge services, valet parking, and landscaped leisure spaces. These amenities are designed to deliver a resort-style living experience inspired by ELLE’s editorial lifestyle vision.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities does ELLE Residences offer?"},{"id":9429,"answer":"<p>Yes, ELLE Residences Dubai Islands is considered a strong investment opportunity due to its prime waterfront location, limited supply, high tourism growth potential, and the global appeal of the ELLE brand. As one of the few luxury apartments in Dubai located within a master-planned coastal destination, Elle Residences by Anax Developments for sale is well positioned for capital appreciation and rental demand.</p>","question":"Is ELLE Residences a good investment in Dubai?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ELLE_Residences_mobile_70aaefeb68.jpg","src_cftle":"i/ELLE_Residences_mobile_70aaefeb68.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/ELLE_Residences_mobile_70aaefeb68.webp","format":